---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Services | HTS International"
  description="Service, repair and spares, technology upgrades and vacuum material feeding systems for injection moulding factories."
>
  <div class="pagehead"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services</p>
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p>Keeping injection moulding and material handling equipment running.</p>
  </div></div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid cols-3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Service, repair &amp; spares</h3>
        <p>Count on HTS International for a full spectrum of services, including diagnostics, repairs and spare parts, all designed to keep your injection moulding and material handling equipment in peak condition.</p>
        <p>Our dedicated team keeps your equipment running smoothly, minimising downtime and maximising productivity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Technology &amp; upgrades</h3>
        <p>Upgrade your existing equipment to run more efficiently and use less energy. We specialise in enhancing your machinery's capabilities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Material feeding systems</h3>
        <p>Material feeding system customisation, from design to supply and installation, so your factory's unique needs are met.</p>
        <p>A system tailored to your specifications.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Vacuum material delivery systems</h2>
      <p>At HTS International, we specialise in designing, supplying, installing, programming and maintaining custom vacuum material delivery systems for your plastic injection moulding factory.</p>
      <h3>Key components</h3>
      <div class="grid cols-2">
        <div class="card"><h4>Vacuum pump</h4><p>The engine of the pneumatic conveying system. It creates negative pressure and air velocity, pulling material from the feed point through the pipe network.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h4>Pipe network</h4><p>A series of horizontally and vertically assembled pipes with bends, routed through your production facility. The network connects feed points to discharge points and accommodates multiple feed points with vacuum conveying.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h4>Receivers</h4><p>Hopper receivers are designed for each injection moulding machine, for a tailored solution.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h4>Control system</h4><p>A control system is essential for all pneumatic conveying systems, and we customise it to suit your specific applications and environment.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact-us#quote">Request a quote</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
